  <rules>
    <rule name="WAAAARGH!" id="a5a3-075e-40e2-129d" hidden="false" page="49" publicationId="9f92-b7df-cf75-9a46">
      <description>Orks have a strategy rating of 3 when it comes to deciding who sets up first. However, the Orks double their strategy to 6 when rolling to see who gets the first turn. This means you would roll 1D6+6 to see who has the first turn.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Ork Missions" id="5d15-d07b-b9ce-f14f" hidden="false" page="49" publicationId="9f92-b7df-cf75-9a46">
      <description>When a mission is selected for Orks, &quot;Witch Hunt&quot; and &quot;The Assassins&quot; should not be included</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Characters and Heavy Weapons" id="f65a-f921-9851-6bb5" hidden="false" page="52" publicationId="9f92-b7df-cf75-9a46">
      <description>Characters with heavy weapons are restricted to the normal targeting rules in the sam way as any other model (see &quot;Choosing a Target&quot; in the 40k rulebook).</description>
    </rule>
  </rules>
