                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Adds +1 to his Toughness 
May headbutt in close combat instead of making a normal attack. If he does this and wins the combat, then he only scores 1 hit, no matter what the margin he beat his opponent&apos;s score by. However, the hit has a Strength of 10 and a -4 saving throw modifier, and causes D3 Wounds</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
