      <rules>
        <rule name="Move Through Cover" id="873e-8aa9-fa42-8604" hidden="false">
          <description>Due to the size of the stomper, objects 2&quot; tall or less may be ignored for movement purposes</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Repairs and Crew Shooting" id="cb07-267b-2b35-7316" hidden="false">
          <description>The Gretchin can fire autoguns out of hatches in 360 degrees. The Mekaniak can repair instead of shooting. Any non-destroyed damage may be repaired on a 1 or 2 on a D12 dice. This number is increased by +1 for each available Gretchin rigger. May attempt repairs once per turn in the shooting phase.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Stompa Damage Table" id="db7c-5365-20ad-9b2a" hidden="false" page="datafax" publicationId="9f92-b7df-cf75-9a46">
