              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">May be used at the end of the vehicle&apos;s movement phase, and makes it move forward another 3D6&quot; in a straight line immediately. If the roll for the distance is 15 or more the vehicle starts to rattle apart - move the vehicle, then roll a D6 on the hull damage table</characteristic>
